:s4273","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:20022","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4273","name":"夏月","detail":"ディレクター、営業・広報","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:222266","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"やつえつこ","creatorId":"egs:creator:35718","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:35718","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:35718","name":"やつえつこ","detail":"音響制作","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:222267","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"Duca","creatorId":"vndb:s386","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s386","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s386","name":"Duca","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:154149","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Duca","creatorId":"vndb:s386","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s386","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s386","name":"Duca","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:154150","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"KIZAWA studio","creatorId":"vndb:s592","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s592","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s592","name":"KIZAWA studio","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:154151","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"夏月","creatorId":"vndb:s4273","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4273","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4273","name":"夏月","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:154155","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c67952","characterName":"琴石 伊織","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"61138","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"237298"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19744"],"vndbCharacterId":"c67952"},"originalCharacterName":"琴石 伊織","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"egs","value":"公式情報なし"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"egs","value":"公式情報なし"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"egs","value":"女性"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A third-year student at Shisui-kan Academy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She’s energetic, lively, and always optimistic."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She transfers to Shisui-kan Academy as a radiant girl whose very presence brightens the atmosphere around her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her motto is to always be true to herself, which sometimes leads to clashes with those around her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In fact, she can be a bit stubborn and won’t back down once she’s made up her mind."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her free-spirited demeanor has led others to describe her as “cat-like.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a long list of “things she wants to do” and is trying to tackle them one by one."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Having been raised with great care by her parents, she’s a bit of a hopeless case when it comes to housework—she’s never really done any before and struggles with both cleaning and cooking."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“Love at first sight? Yeah, I’m the type to believe in it…"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"But do you even have a partner?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Wait, maybe you haven’t noticed? You’re so clueless!”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated with DeepL.com (free version)"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67952"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"元気で活発、いつも前向き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いるだけで周囲を明るくするような華のある女の子で紫翠舘学園に転入してくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どんなときでも自分に正直でいることをモットーにしているため、周囲とぶつかったりすることもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"事実、ちょっぴり頑固なところがあり、一度決めたら譲らない所も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自由奔放に見えるその様子を周りからは「猫みたい」と例えられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何やら「やりたいこと」がたくさんあって、それを片っ端からやろうとしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親に大切に育てられてきたこともあり、今までほとんど家事をやったことがなく掃除、料理ともに苦手なプチ残念女子。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19744","sourceWorkId":"26538","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"紫翠館学園3年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元気で活発、いつも前向き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いるだけで周囲を明るくするような華のある女の子で紫翠舘学園に転入してくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どんなときでも自分に正直でいることをモットーにしているため、 周囲とぶつかったりすることもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"事実、ちょっぴり頑固なところがあり、一度決めたら譲らない所も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自由奔放に見えるその様子を周りからは「猫みたい」と例えられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何やら「やりたいこと」がたくさんあって、それを片っ端からやろうとしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親に大切に育てられてきたこともあり、今までほとんど家事をやったことがなく掃除、料理ともに苦手なプチ残念女子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「一目惚れ？　うん、私は信じる方だけど……"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰か相手はいるのか、って……"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もしかして、気づいてないの？　鈍感！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61138"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5a/5a2b8e59256481b8bc4c78d141c27d076b60ebed0a7cf1a40e8bbf05958a8f07.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e7/e7e330ad01c3375e3cde3ee40162a00157419aa30b3cd4088f407327757f6b5f.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"くすはら ゆい","creatorId":"vndb:s985","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s985","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s985","name":"石原 舞","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:79970","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c67953","characterName":"早見 美里","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"61139","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"237298"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19745"],"vndbCharacterId":"c67953"},"originalCharacterName":"早見 美里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A third-year student at Shisui-kan Academy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is Rei’s childhood friend who lives in the neighborhood."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her family runs a French restaurant called “Bistro Soleil.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is always cheerful and kind, and can easily get along with people she meets for the first time."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While she isn’t exactly the center of the class, she is the type of person everyone trusts."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Also, despite her somewhat reserved personality, she has a girly side—she loves romantic dramas, for example."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her family has a close relationship with Rei’s family, and she helps out at Rei’s shop whenever she can."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Regular customers affectionately call her “the little bride,” and she doesn’t seem to mind it at all."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She’s very feminine, with nimble fingers and a knack for getting things done."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"But for some reason, she’s not very good at cooking."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She’s always wanted to take care of Rei, but since he’s the type who can take care of himself, she hasn’t been able to do so yet."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“Until now, I thought of him as family…"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"But seeing him like this, I realize he really is just a boy after all. Hehe.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated with DeepL.com (free version)"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67953"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"怜の近所に住んでいる幼馴染み。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実家は『ビストロ ソレイユ』というフレンチレストランを経営している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも朗らかで優しく、初対面の相手とも仲良くなることができる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスの中心というわけではないが、誰からも信頼されているタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、やや控えめな性格ながら恋愛ドラマが好きだったりと乙女な面も持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"怜の家とは家族ぐるみの付き合いがあり、行けるときには怜のお店を手伝っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常連さんからは「お嫁ちゃん」と言われて親しまれていて本人も満更でもないご様子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女子力は高く、手先が器用で要領もよい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"でも、なぜか料理は少し苦手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"怜の世話を焼きたいと常々思っているが自分のことは自分でできる系の男子であるため、今のところできずにいる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19745","sourceWorkId":"26538","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"紫翠館学園3年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"怜の近所に住んでいる幼馴染み。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実家は『ビストロ ソレイユ』というフレンチレストランを経営している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも朗らかで優しく、初対面の相手とも仲良くなることができる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスの中心というわけではないが、誰からも信頼されているタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、やや控えめな性格ながら恋愛ドラマが好きだったりと乙女な面も持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"怜の家とは家族ぐるみの付き合いがあり、行けるときには怜のお店を手伝っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常連さんからは「お嫁ちゃん」と言われて親しまれていて本人も満更でもないご様子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女子力は高く、手先が器用で要領もよい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"でも、なぜか料理は少し苦手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"怜の世話を焼きたいと常々思っているが自分のことは自分でできる系の男子であるため、今のところできずにいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「今までは、家族みたいな存在だって思ってたけど……"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"こうしてると、やっぱり男の子なんだなぁって感じちゃう。えへへ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61139"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a8/a846cf77a89f7eb20311f58381da35a2a031d113d0df39ca8cce9bddb195b18c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bc/bccfef3dfc35210c3221f5d7b36dc7a5ccf4b2240b87de0a961265b71f151a54.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"礼賀 椎衣","creatorId":"vndb:s416","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s416","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s416","name":"清水 愛","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:79972","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c67954","characterName":"宮音 沙希","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"61140","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"237298"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19746"],"vndbCharacterId":"c67954"},"originalCharacterName":"宮音 沙希","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A second-year student at Shisui-kan Academy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a young actress currently making a name for herself in the entertainment industry."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a cheerful personality and is always smiling."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Due to the nature of her work, she often interacts with people older than her, but she speaks clearly and confidently without being intimidated."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While she doesn’t take the lead in getting everyone excited, she has a playful side and likes to crack little jokes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She lives alone in an apartment away from her parents."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Balancing work and school is difficult, and it seems she is often late or has to leave early due to work commitments."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She didn’t mind cooking or cleaning at first, but now she’s so short on time that she often eats simple meals and hasn’t been able to keep up with cleaning her room or doing laundry."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At work, she usually eats boxed lunches."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"On her days off, she says she “prefers to do as little as possible.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In that sense, there’s a gap between her public image and her private life."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“Starting tomorrow, can I come here for dinner?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"I don’t think I can go back to eating such bland meals.”"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67954"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"若手女優として芸能界で活躍中の女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は明るく、常に笑顔を絶やさない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仕事柄、年上の相手と接することも多いが、物怖じせずにはきはきと話す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"先頭に立ってはしゃいだりはしないものの茶目っ気もあり、ちょっとした冗談を言うことも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"親元を離れてマンションで一人暮らしをしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仕事と学業の両立は大変で、仕事の都合で遅刻や早退をすることも多々ある模様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元々は料理や掃除も嫌いではなかったが、今は時間がなさすぎて、食事も簡単にすませていたり、部屋の掃除、洗濯もあまりできていない状態になっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仕事の時はロケ弁当が多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"休みの日は「なるべく何もしたくない」というほど。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そう言った意味では、外向きとのギャップがある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19746","sourceWorkId":"26538","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"紫翠館学園2年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"若手女優として芸能界で活躍中の女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は明るく、常に笑顔を絶やさない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仕事柄、年上の相手と接することも多いが、物怖じせずにはきはきと話す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"先頭に立ってはしゃいだりはしないものの茶目っ気もあり、ちょっとした冗談を言うことも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"親元を離れてマンションで一人暮らしをしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仕事と学業の両立は大変で、仕事の都合で遅刻や早退をすることも多々ある模様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元々は料理や掃除も嫌いではなかったが、今は時間がなさすぎて、食事も簡単にすませていたり、部屋の掃除、洗濯もあまりできていない状態になっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仕事の時はロケ弁当が多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"休みの日は「なるべく何もしたくない」というほど。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そう言った意味では、外向きとのギャップがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「明日から夕ご飯、ここに食べに来てもいいですか？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もう味気ない食事には戻れませんね」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61140"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e8/e82424cd989ad6a743662a69ae19c0884c1725fafc5b37777634eb37cf286c4c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b98d9c8c24e65c3bd170fe11ea44d8dff1ca7f57b0d626547177cef98ada0a63.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"秋野 花","creatorId":"vndb:s902","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s902","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s902","name":"あさみ ほとり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:79969","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c67955","characterName":"来未 さなえ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"61141","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"237298"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19747"],"vndbCharacterId":"c67955"},"originalCharacterName":"来未 さなえ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A third-year student at Shisui-kan Academy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She serves as class president for Rei and the others’ class."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a quiet, reserved personality, is very considerate, and gives her all to everything she does."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she sometimes feels a little daunted by the responsibility of leading the class,"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"she keeps at it because she loves seeing everyone smile."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She’s skilled at all kinds of household chores, like cooking and cleaning."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She makes meals that keep well and can be eaten right after heating them up,"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"and when tidying up, she makes good use of dead space—so she’s more of a homebody than just “girly.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Even at her age, she’s already the type of girl people say, “She’ll make a great mom.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a clear complex about her lack of bust."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When she sees her well-endowed classmates, she looks on enviously, thinking, “(T-that’s so nice…)”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“...It’s a little depressing that you can tell whose laundry it is just by the bra size...”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated with DeepL.com (free version)"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67955"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"怜たちのクラスの委員長を務めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格はおとなしめで気配り上手、何事にも一所懸命。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスをまとめていく仕事には少し気後れすることもあるけれど、誰かが笑顔になってくれるのが嬉しくて頑張っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"料理や掃除など家事全般が得意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"温めればすぐに食べられる日持ちのする料理を作ったり、片付けの際にはデッドスペースを有効利用したりと女子力が高いというよりは家庭的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"この歳にして早くも「いいお母さんになれそう」女子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"胸がないのがあきらかなコンプレックス。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スタイルの良い同級生を見て「(い、いいなぁ……)」と羨ましがったりしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19747","sourceWorkId":"26538","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"紫翠館学園3年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"怜たちのクラスの委員長を務めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格はおとなしめで気配り上手、何事にも一所懸命。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスをまとめていく仕事には少し気後れすることもあるけれど、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰かが笑顔になってくれるのが嬉しくて頑張っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"料理や掃除など家事全般が得意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"温めればすぐに食べられる日持ちのする料理を作ったり、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"片付けの際にはデッドスペースを有効利用したりと女子力が高いというよりは家庭的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"この歳にして早くも「いいお母さんになれそう」女子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"胸がないのがあきらかなコンプレックス。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スタイルの良い同級生を見て「（い、いいなぁ……）」と羨ましがったりしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「……ブラのサイズで、誰の洗濯物かわかるのって少し凹むよね……」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61141"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3f8cdb032fd1f0e8b20c9326eab0771fdb0f273c1cb1091aeee9a950d7f9fb26.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/82/82b372190341353efadc52ede1df2a650b2f76074df6a00824b2a95e8f8b80ea.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"歩 サラ","creatorId":"vndb:s874","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s874","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s874","name":"岡本 理絵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:79968","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c67956","characterName":"西園寺 蓉子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"61142","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"237298"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19748"],"vndbCharacterId":"c67956"},"originalCharacterName":"西園寺 蓉子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"egs","value":"公式情報なし"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"egs","value":"公式情報なし"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"egs","value":"女性"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A beautiful girl with a personality Smart, refined, mature and mischievous. Her Hobbies In the evening she likes to drink tea while enjoying the scenery around her house. love self-reliance without the help of her maid and loved by the people around her. She likes food cooked by Rei and Rei respect her as a older sister. she came from a very wealthy family."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67956"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"さっぱりした性格の美人さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"興味を持ったことは取り合えずやってみるタイプで、ややトラブルメーカー気質。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"要領自体はとても良く、さらには愛嬌まであるため多少のトラブルも込みで愛されてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"イタズラも比較的好きで、ボディタッチ多め。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"怜に対してはお姉さんぶるところがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"名家の出身であり、幼い頃からお嬢様として様々な習い事を修めてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の成績も良く、運動神経も抜群。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、恵まれた能力を持っているにも関わらず性格はわりとだらしなく、毎日フラフラとしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やればできるけどやらない系女子。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19748","sourceWorkId":"26538","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"聖蘭女学園3年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"さっぱりした性格の美人さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"興味を持ったことは取り合えずやってみるタイプで、ややトラブルメーカー気質。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"要領自体はとても良く、さらには愛嬌まであるため多少のトラブルも込みで愛されてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"イタズラも比較的好きで、ボディタッチ多め。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"怜に対してはお姉さんぶるところがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"名家の出身であり、幼い頃からお嬢様として様々な習い事を修めてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の成績も良く、運動神経も抜群。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、恵まれた能力を持っているにも関わらず性格はわりとだらしなく、毎日フラフラとしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やればできるけどやらない系女子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ふふっ、怜君が恥ずかしがってるのを見るの、けっこう好きかも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"これは冗談なんかじゃないよ……？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61142"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6d/6d5cb19ada10c9a2ce98ba84fa509b32c44475c166fb96ac83d67d77b80c7a63.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/50/501c041f957a61fd1a960d956662f88b21105e6ab1c36b9557bdf24abed052ee.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"北見 六花","creatorId":"vndb:s367","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s367","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s367","name":"小野 涼子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:79966","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c67957","characterName":"藤堂 なずな","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"61143","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"237298"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19749"],"vndbCharacterId":"c67957"},"originalCharacterName":"藤堂 なずな","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A first-year student at Seiran Girls' Academy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rei's cousin, two years his junior. She is a gentle and soft-spoken girl."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Having lived in Kyoto her entire life, she had always wanted to visit Tokyo to broaden her horizons."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She obtained her parents' permission on the condition that Yuno would look after her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She remembers playing with Rei often when they were young, and she still calls him “Big Brother” and is very attached to him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She excels at housework, cooking, and cleaning."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a somewhat old-fashioned girl who embodies the saying, “Take three steps back to support a man.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Occasionally, perhaps out of habit, she slips into the speech patterns of a courtesan."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“Ah, Big Brother, please wait a moment. Your tie is crooked, isn’t it?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"…There, it’s fixed. Hehe, you’re as wonderful as ever, Big Brother.”"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67957"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"怜の二つ年下の従妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"穏やかで柔和な物腰の女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃からずっと京都にいたため、一度は東京に出て見識を広めたいと思っていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"由乃が面倒を見てくれるのなら、ということで両親に許可をもらう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃に怜とよく遊んだ記憶があり、今も「兄さま」と呼んで懐いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家事、料理、掃除は大の得意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「三歩下がって男性を立てる」を地でいようなやや古風な子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また時折、くせなのか花魁言葉が出てしまうことも。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19749","sourceWorkId":"26538","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"聖蘭女学園1年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"怜の二つ年下の従妹。穏やかで柔和な物腰の女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃からずっと京都にいたため、一度は東京に出て見識を広めたいと思っていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"由乃が面倒を見てくれるのなら、ということで両親に許可をもらう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃に怜とよく遊んだ記憶があり、今も「兄さま」と呼んで懐いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家事、料理、掃除は大の得意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「三歩下がって男性を立てる」を地でいようなやや古風な子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また時折、くせなのか花魁言葉が出てしまうことも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あ、兄さま、待ちなんし。ネクタイが曲がっていますよ？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"……はい、直りました。ふふっ、兄さまは相変わらず素敵です」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61143"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e9/e934115b2120ff29a8457590abf09756125966fadaf786681691eba7eb46a50d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b7/b79de7503939febb1abf3db5eb99099e531cf980d6b2789a5db399f974876b48.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤咲 ウサ","creatorId":"vndb:s608","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s608","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s608","name":"藤咲ウサ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:79967","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c67951","characterName":"